OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain throughout. Rain
OL,7,Fwill mostly be light and patchy but
OL,8,Fsome heavier bursts are possible,
OL,9,Fespecially across the west of Dumfries
OL,10,Fand Galloway.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a cloudy evening
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of light and patchy
OL,14,Frain continuing. Remaining cloudy
OL,15,Fovernight with rain becoming confined
OL,16,Fto the southwest and the east drier.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
