OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThe east will be dry with
OL,6,Fbright and sunny spells. Cloudier in
OL,7,Fthe west with light rain possible in
OL,8,Fthe morning, drier with some brighter
OL,9,Fspells developing in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA few
OL,12,Fshowers in the east Friday, otherwise
OL,13,Fmostly dry and cold Friday and
OL,14,FSaturday with some long sunny spells
OL,15,Fand overnight frost. Turning cloudier
OL,16,FSunday with rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
